        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brian_Head%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "With a mean annual snowfall of over 368 inches, Brian Head is one of the snowiest inhabited places in the United States.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brian_Head%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The area was first discovered by the Fremont Tribe and later settled in the mid 1800s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
